{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリとかはまだ内緒だから\nレポにならなそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ったので\nその他のことをいろいろ書いていきまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ\nツアー始まりましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が食べた&持ち帰ったもの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年も人気だった安定の\n萩の月と蔵王クリームチーズと喜久福"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは\nクマの手シューラスク、ずんだ餅ぷち、支倉焼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいわーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お土産におぬぬめだよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてですね\n今日、中田の誕生日ということで\nライブ中に祝っていただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日のお花もたくさん\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て！こんなに大きいケーキ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「2015.8.6」のクッキー\n丸々食べちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Happy Birthdayかなりん」は\nさゆりんが食べてました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しあわせ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ははは\nスイーツの話ばっかり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけでですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台来てくださったみなさん\n本当に本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでいただけましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のライブ気づいたら\n1公演につき1Lの水を飲んでいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部汗になるくらい\n全力でございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1リットルの汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか聞いたことある響きだけど\nまあそこはおいといて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい夏になりそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね\n『真夏の全国ツアーご来場キャンペーン』の福引券\n中田作るの手伝ったよ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/06/6780756/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった方いるかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":